Just when you thought you knew all there was to know about Scott Pilgrim comes Scott Pilgrim Color Hardcover Volume 1: Precious Little Life! The first in a series of brand-new hardcover editions, this remastered, 6"x9" hardcover presents Scott's first "evil ex" battle as you've never seen it before - in full-color! Plus, previously unpublished extras and bonus materials make this mighty tome one that's required reading for Scottaholics everywhere!"î
ëScott Pilgrim just turned 24, and things couldn't possibly be better! This means things are about to get infinitely worse. Suddenly, TWO of Ramona's evil ex-boyfriends are in town, and they're playing dirty. His band is in turmoil, and his own exes aren't making things any easier. And what's up with Ramona, anyway? She's been acting kinda weird ever since they moved in together. It's the SECOND LAST VOLUME of SCOTT PILGRIM: Scott's precious little life is coming back around to bite him in the butt, and it may not be pretty!"ô
ñBesoboi lishilsia svoikh sposobnostei, no razve eto mozhet pomeshat' nastoiashchemu geroiu zashchishchat' rodnoi gorod? Osobenno seichas, kogda legiony Ada ustraivaiut mezhdousobnye voiny priamo na ulitsakh Moskvy! V vodovorot protivostoianiia okazyvaiutsia vtianuty bezdomnaia devochka Iana, v kotoruiu mogut vseliat'sia demony, mogushchestvennaia organizatsiia <>, okhraniaiushchaia planetu ot potustoronnikh sil, a takzhe tainstvennyi Khoziain Pautiny, liuboi tsenoi stremiashchiisia vyrvat'sia iz zatocheniia v Limbe. Sumeet li Danila razrubit' uzel etogo konflikta i spasti nevinnykh liudei?
Piatyi tom soderzhit vypuski komiksa <>No. 28-33 (istorii <>, <>, <>i <>), a takzhe unikal'nye dopolnitel'nye materialy: sketchi, kontsepty, eskizy personazhei i kommentarii sozdatelei komiksa."´
®Igor' Grom - opytnyi sledovatel' iz Sankt-Peterburga, izvestnyi svoim probivnym kharakterom i neprimirimoi pozitsiei po otnosheniiu k prestupnikam vsekh mastei. Neimovernaia sila, analiticheskii sklad uma i nepodkupnost' - vsio eto delaet maiora Groma ideal'nym politseiskim. Rabotaia ne pokladaia ruk, on vsegda dovodit nachatoe do kontsa i nikogda ne pasuet pered trudnostiami, stoiashchimi na puti.
Soderzhit 1-5 vypuski."≠
™Igor' Grom - opytnyi sledovatel' iz Sankt-Peterburga, izvestnyi svoim probivnym kharakterom i neprimirimoi pozitsiei po otnosheniiu k prestupnikam vsekh mastei. Neimovernaia sila, analiticheskii sklad uma i nepodkupnost' - vsio eto delaet maiora Groma ideal'nym politseiskim. Rabotaia ne pokladaia ruk, on vsegda dovodit nachatoe do kontsa i nikogda ne pasuet pered trudnostiami, stoiashchimi na puti.
Soderzhit 11-18 vypuski."Ø
¨Martin -- sovsem nebol'shoi, razmerom primerno s koshku, govoriashchii slon. Ran'she ego zvali Probirka_7, potomu chto roditeli Marka, Idy, Dzheremi i Lu Smit-Tompsonov sozdali ego v dalekoi indiiskoi laboratorii (da, starshie Smit-Tompsony zhivut dalekovato, no deti poka spravliaiutsia) i prislali detiam posylkoi -- bez kakikh-libo osobykh ob'iasnenii. Vam mozhet pokazat'sia, chto eto chistoe schast'e -- imet' v dome kroshechnogo govoriashchego slona, -- i deistvitel'no, Smit-Tompsony ochen' liubiat Martina. Vot tol'ko inogda Martin uzhasno gromko igraet na volynke. I fal'shivo poet pod nee russkie romansy. I norovit mazat' dzhem na buterbrod pri pomoshchi khobota, i kataetsia na kalitke, i trebuet, chtoby ego myli v vanne s kokosovoi penoi, i vidit khomiachkovye privideniia. I eshche on izo vsekh sil, po-nastoiashchemu i navechno vliubliaetsia v devochku Dinu i reshaet byt' ee Rytsarem i Boevym Slonom. Tak chto ne obol'shchaites', pozhaluista: imet' v dome govoriashchego slona sovsem, sovsem, sovsem neprosto. Dazhe esli on razmerom primerno s koshku."∂
≥Inok reshaet raz i navsegda izbavit'sia ot famil'nogo kresta, prinesshego emu stol'ko bed. No nachat' novuiu zhizn' Andreiu tak i ne udaetsia - vstrecha s tainstvennym avantiuristom i okhotnikom za relikviiami Serym Volkom zatiagivaet geroia v ocherednoi vodovorot neveroiatnykh sobytii!
Vypuski s 18 po 21."¿
ΩDanila-Besoboi - mrachnyi mstitel' v kapiushone, istrebliaiushchii demonov. V 2008 godu on sluzhil mirotvortsem v Tskhinvali i poterial sem'iu v rezul'tate rezni, ustroennoi chudovishchami iz Preispodnei. I teper' on bez ustali unichtozhaet adskikh tvarei, pytaias' sderzhat' infernal'noe vtorzhenie... No chto, esli vsio eto - tol'ko chast' pravdy? Kto zhe takoi Besoboi? Chto on na samom dele pomnit o svoiom proshlom, o svoei zhizni? Za chto i radi chego on na samom dele srazhaetsia? V popytkakh naiti otvety na eti voprosy v soznanie Danily pronikaet kovarnyi nochnoi koshmar po imeni Balor...
Chetvertyi tom soderzhit vypuski No. 23-27 (istorii "Ravnovesie", "Chistaia dusha", "Drug" i "Balor")."¬
øDanila-Besoboi. Igor' Grom. Andrei Radov. Nika Chaikina. Liliia Romanova. Aliona Kuznetsova. Dolgoe vremia my sledili za nimi, nabliudaia za vzliotami i padeniiami, pobedami i porazheniiami... No chto, esli by sud'ba etikh liudei slozhilas' inache? Ostalis' by oni temi zhe geroiami, kak i prezhde? I kak by izmenilsia mir vokrug nikh? <>- mesto, gde nachinaiutsia al'ternativnye istorii geroev komiksov BUBBLE. Mesto, gde mozhet sluchit'sia vsio!"∆
√Just when you thought you knew all there was to know about Scott Pilgrim comes Scott Pilgrim Color Hardcover Volume 1: Precious Little Life! The first in a series of brand-new hardcover editions, this remastered, 6"x9" hardcover presents Scott's first "evil ex" battle as you've never seen it before - in full-color! Plus, previously unpublished extras and bonus materials make this mighty tome one that's required reading for Scottaholics everywhere!" 
«My zhiviom v koshmarnoe vremia. Vremia, kogda samye otvratitel'nye vyrodki chuvstvuiut sebia kak ryba v vode, a prostye liudi okazyvaiutsia broshennymi na proizvol sud'by.
Narkomany. Bandity. Ubiitsy. Grabiteli. Nasil'niki... Podonki vsekh mastei obezumeli v svoei zhestokosti. Privyknuv k bezzakoniiu i nespravedlivosti, oni postepenno prevrashchaiut stranu v filial Ada na zemle.
I deistvitel'no: sozdaniia iz samoi preispodnei otkryto predlagaiut svoi uslugi liudiam s chiornoi dushoi. Poddavshis' iskusheniiu, mnogie prestupniki zakliuchaiut sdelku s adskimi otrod'iami, otdavaia svoiu svobodu v obmen na nediuzhinnuiu silu i mogushchestvo. S kazhdoi sekundoi zlo stanovitsia sil'nee, raskalionnye vrata Ada postepenno otkryvaiutsia, i legiony demonov zhdut, kogda zhe im udastsia porezvit'sia na vole...
No slovno iz niotkuda poiavliaetsia Danila-Besoboi! Mrachnyi mstitel' v kapiushone nameren vernut' strane prezhnii pokoi. S pomoshch'iu tsinichnogo besionka-perebezhchika po klichke <>on vyslezhivaet i unichtozhaet demonov, staraias' sderzhat' infernal'noe vtorzhenie!
Vypuski s 1 po 7."œ	
Ã	Inoplanetnye monstry, kotorykh zemliane prozvali mimikami, bezzhalostno okkupiruiut planetu - razrushaiut krupnye goroda, gubiat milliony chelovecheskikh zhiznei. Armii vsekh stran ob'edinili sily, chtoby vstupit' v reshaiushchuiu skhvatku s beschislennymi polchishchami agressorov. Novobrantsa Keidzi Kiriiu, nepodgotovlennogo i plokho snariazhennogo, kak i mnogikh ego tovarishchei, brosili v samuiu gushchu boia, fakticheski obrekaia na smert'. Odnako, pogibaia, Keidzi zabiraet i zhizn' prishel'tsa. I sluchaetsia neveroiatnoe - Kiriia vnov' okazyvaetsia nakanune togo adskogo dnia i, zamknuv vremennuiu petliu, vynuzhden teper' srazhat'sia i umirat', raz za razom otpravliaias' v tot samyi boi. No s kazhdym vozvrashcheniem Keidzh stanovitsia bolee zhestokim, bolee umelym, srazhaias' bok o bok s proslavlennym boitsom spetsnaza Ritoi Vrataski, unichtozhivshei bol'she vragov, chem kto-libo drugoi na Zemle. I kazhdoe povtoriaiushcheesia srazhenie priblizhaet ikh k razgadke togo, kak odolet' inoplanetnykh zakhvatchikov i vyrvat'sia iz vremennogo plena. Chto zhdet ikh s tainstvennoi soiuznitsei - spasenie ili okonchatel'naia smert'?
Po romanu sniat fantasticheskii boevik s Tomom Kruzom i Emili Blant v glavnykh roliakh."“
œNiku Chaikinu po prozvishchu "Krasnaia Furiia" i ee komandu zhdet novaia missiia. Na etot raz geroiam predstoit otpravitsia v Chili, na territoriiu nemetskogo poseleniia "Villa Bav'era", kotoroe skryvaet strashnuiu tainu...
A tem vremenem v Antarktide razvorachivaetsia neshutochnaia bitva mezhdu neskol'kimi moguchimi organizatsiiami, kazhdaia iz kotorykh stremitsia zakhvatit' nepristupnuiu krepost' "Asulburg"... Kto zhe vyidet pobeditelem?
Vypuski s 16 po 19."Ÿ
÷Vo vremia svoikh puteshestvii Andrei Radov spas mnozhestvo mirov, i, nakonets, prishlo vremia zasluzhennoi nagrady: on poluchaet vozmozhnost' vernut' k zhizni svoiu nevestu Ksiushu! V popytke voskresit' liubimuiu Inok otpravliaetsia v Tsarstvo miortvykh Nav', chtoby vstretit'sia s ego khranitel'nitsei - Baboi Iagoi... Sumeet li geroi spasti Ksiushu i chem on gotov pozhertvovat' radi zhizni vozliublennoi?
Shestoi tom soderzhit vypuski komiksa <>No. 32-38 (istorii <>, <>i <>), a takzhe unikal'nye dopolnitel'nye materialy: sketchi, kontsepty, eskizy personazhei i kommentarii sozdatelei komiksa."€
ÿDrevnee zlo vozvrashchaetsia v nash mir: Bog-Voron Kutkh vozrozhdaetsia, chtoby vnov' nesti povsiudu smert' i razrusheniia. I poka Danila-Besoboi i ego vernyi naparnik Shmyg pytaiutsia ostanovit' chudovishche i ego prisluzhnikov, ikh dom ostaiotsia bez zashchity. Bezdomnaia devushka Iana, kotoruiu priiutili geroi, okazyvaetsia odna, ne podozrevaia, chto v eio soznanii ukryvaetsia nochnoi koshmar po imeni Balor... A tem vremenem v Adu nachinaetsia novaia igra: vyrvavshiisia iz plena Antikhrist pletiot intrigi, chtoby zakhvatit' Tsitadel' - istochnik vlasti nad vsemi demonami Preispodnei!
---
Sed'moi tom soderzhit ne tol'ko vypuski komiksa <>No. 38-42 (istorii <>, <>i <>), no i novye stranitsy, kotorykh ne bylo v singlakh, a takzhe NEBYVALOE kolichestvo dopolnitel'nykh materialov v ispolnenii Anastasii Phobs Kim! Sketchi, kontsepty, eskizy personazhei i kommentarii sozdatelei komiksa -- bolee 70 stranits etogo dobra vy naidiote v novoi knige.
Vozrastnye ogranicheniia: 16+"ﬂ
‹Roman Kotkov, Nataliia Devova, Artiom Gabrelianov, Aleks Khatchett, Evgenii Fedotov, Igor' Khudaev, Artem Biziaev, Andrei Rodin, Eduard Petrovich, Andrei Vasin, Anastasiia Kim, Nina Vakueva, Konstantin Tarasov, Anna Rud'"Á
‰Uzhasy Kostianogo Doma ostalis' pozadi, i teper' Lilii Romanovoi, poluchivshei svoi magicheskii tsvet, predstoit oshchutit' vse <>obucheniia v Nastoiashchei Moskovskoi Biblioteke! Ogromnyi krokodil, vyrvavshiisia iz detskoi skazki, personazhi-zagovorshchiki, pugaiushchie teni, puteshestvie vnutr' drevnei knigi <>- i vsio eto za odnu nedeliu? Sumeet li Lilia spravit'sia so vsemi trudnostiami i stat' nastoiashchim knigocheem?
Tretii tom soderzhit vypuski komiksa <>No. 11-17 (istorii <>i <>), a takzhe unikal'nye dopolnitel'nye materialy: sketchi, kontsepty, eskizy personazhei i kommentarii sozdatelei komiksa"Î

